   "no": 1,
   "en": "PROBLEM",
   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>钻井问题：</b>同样钻进300小时，弯曲和振动不同导致损伤不同。</p><p><b>具体方法：</b>5近邻回归＋Miner机理对照；输入为狗腿度、振动强度与转速。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>学习工况到平均损伤速率的映射，辅助寿命复核。</p></div><p>旋转钻具在弯曲井段承受交变载荷。S-N 曲线用材料参数描述应力幅与可承受循环次数的关系，Miner 准则把不同载荷档位造成的损伤相加。</p><p>如果只看服役时间，就忽略了不同载荷记录的差异。本例以合成工况比较“累积损伤”和“固定时间基线”，用于观察模型对输入的响应；没有逐根钻具台账或真实断裂时刻。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻具弯曲疲劳原理与S-N曲线'><text x='20' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>狗腿段：每转一周交变一次</text><path d='M30,60 L150,60 L330,95' fill='none' stroke='#c9d4e4' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M30,120 L150,120 L330,155' fill='none' stroke='#c9d4e4' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M40,90 L150,90 L320,125' fill='none' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='5' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='300' y='82' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>井眼上壁</text><text x='300' y='172' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>井眼下壁</text><circle cx='100' cy='90' r='16' fill='none' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.1' stroke-dasharray='4 3' marker-end='url(#arD4a)'/><path d='M116,90 A16,16 0 0 1 100,106' fill='none' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.1' marker-end='url(#arD4a)'/><text x='100' y='130' font-size='9' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>旋转</text><text x='160' y='76' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51'>外侧：拉 → 压 → 拉</text><text x='160' y='112' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51'>狗腿曲率影响弯曲应力幅（示意）</text><text x='24' y='200' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a'>弯曲应力幅 σ = E·(d/2)·κ（κ 为狗腿曲率），</text><text x='24' y='216' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a'>振动载荷会改变有效应力幅。</text><line x1='360' y1='22' x2='360' y2='236' stroke='#dfe6f0' stroke-width='1'/><text x='382' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>S-N 曲线：应力幅定寿命</text><line x1='400' y1='50' x2='400' y2='190' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='400' y1='190' x2='690' y2='190' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M415,62 C470,84 530,120 660,158' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='452' cy='80' r='4' fill='#b05a51'/><text x='462' y='74' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51'>高应力幅对应较少可承受循环（示意）</text><circle cx='560' cy='146' r='4' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='570' y='140' font-size='9' fill='#64748b'>低应力幅对应较多循环（示意）</text><text x='690' y='204' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='end'>应力幅（对数） →</text><text x='392' y='60' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='end'>循环次数（对数）↑</text><text x='540' y='232' font-size='9.5' fill='#202b38' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>循环次数取决于所用材料曲线参数</text><defs><marker id='arD4a' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#41699b'/></marker></defs></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>原理示意</b><span>狗腿弯曲与 S-N 曲线用于解释计算原理。图上两种工况仅作定性示意，不是材料试验或现场寿命测量。</span></div>"
